# eFa-next cluster: the bans the other nodes of the cluster found, set here by efa-cluster (fail2ban-client set efa-cluster banip).
# No log of its own (nothing matches the journal filter); on every port for the time the master keeps a ban in its table.
# recidive does not count these bans (filter.d/recidive.local): one event on one node is not a repeat offence on every node.
[efa-cluster]
enabled = true
filter =
backend = systemd
journalmatch = _SYSTEMD_UNIT=efa-cluster-bans.none
banaction = %(banaction_allports)s
maxretry = 1
bantime = 3600
